<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S9.T5.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="S9.T5.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:113%;">RealEstate10K <math id="S9.T5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{V_{C}}\mathbf{{=}2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟐</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{V_{C}}\mathbf{{=}2}</annotation></semantics></math>, SVSM Encoder-Decoder.<span id="S9.T5.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> SVSM Encoder-Decoder model settings used to sweep scaling laws for the stereo (<math id="S9.T5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V_{C}{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{C}{=}2</annotation></semantics></math>) novel view synthesis setting. </span>Bolded<span id="S9.T5.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> is the row for the compute-matched, Pareto-optimal SVSM model compared against the 24-layer LVSM Decoder-only model.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
